[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3508112344","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112575#issuecomment-3508112344","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112575","id":3508112344,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7RGYvY","user":{"login":"timothyqiu","id":372476,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MjQ3Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/372476?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu","html_url":"https://github.com/timothyqiu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-09T12:09:42Z","updated_at":"2025-11-09T12:09:42Z","body":"I think it needs to consider escapes of the escape characters.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"573\" height=\"190\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fdc1fe35-1c24-409b-ae2f-28f8aca7c1b4\" />\r\n\r\n-  `{{`, `}}` , and `%%` are not placeholders.\r\n- `{{}}` is hightlighted incorrectly anyway (see the last character).\r\n\r\n<details><summary>Code</summary>\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\tprint(\"Hello %s\" % \"World\")\r\n\tprint(\"Hello %s: %%\" % \"World\")\r\n\t\r\n\tprint(\"Hello {foo}\".format({foo=\"World\"}))\r\n\tprint(\"Hello {foo}: {{}}\".format({foo=\"World\"}))\r\n```\r\n</details>","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3508112344/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3508211993","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112575#issuecomment-3508211993","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112575","id":3508211993,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7RGxEZ","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-09T12:27:59Z","updated_at":"2025-11-09T12:27:59Z","body":"Amusingly timothyqiu's code snippet shows that GitHub's highlighting (which comes from [Linguist](https://github.com/github-linguist/linguist/tree/main)) already highlights `%`, albeit almost unconditionally. `{` and  `}` are accounted for to not highlight excessive brackets, but any text inside nested brackets is not.\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nprint(\"Hello %1.2f: %% \" % \"World\")\r\nprint(\"Hello {dummy}: {{nested}} {one_too_many}}\")\r\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3508211993/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":1,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3508258211","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112575#issuecomment-3508258211","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112575","id":3508258211,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7RG8Wj","user":{"login":"timothyqiu","id":372476,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MjQ3Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/372476?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu","html_url":"https://github.com/timothyqiu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-09T12:46:25Z","updated_at":"2025-11-09T12:46:25Z","body":"Speaking of this, I just realized that, apparently, Godot's `format()` is too flexible: :rofl: \r\n\r\n<img width=\"686\" height=\"155\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6a4f3ed3-784f-483f-ab62-00b3ba3a6d41\" />\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\n\t# Hello World: What\r\n\tprint(\"Hello {foo}: {{}}\".format({foo=\"World\", \"{}\"=\"What\"}))\r\n\t\r\n\t# Hello World {foo}\r\n\tprint(\"Hello [foo] {foo}\".format({foo=\"World\"}, \"[_]\"))\r\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3508258211/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3508334675","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112575#issuecomment-3508334675","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112575","id":3508334675,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7RHPBT","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-09T13:44:48Z","updated_at":"2025-11-09T13:44:48Z","body":"I don't mind this and understand why it might be convenient for users, but I'm a bit upset when similar functionality in other editors triggers false positives.\r\n\r\nIn my opinion, it would be much better if this highlighting only worked in the appropriate contexts: `%...` substitution only if the string literal is the left operand of the `%` operator, `{...}` substitution only if the `format()` method is called on the string literal (ideally, taking into account the second argument). However:\r\n\r\n1. This requires looking ahead in the highlighter.\r\n2. It leads to false negatives (for example, no highlighting for string constants to which `%` or `format()` is applied later).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3508334675/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3508389037","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112575#issuecomment-3508389037","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112575","id":3508389037,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7RHcSt","user":{"login":"Cykyrios","id":53737317,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNzM3MzE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53737317?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios","html_url":"https://github.com/Cykyrios","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-09T14:06:37Z","updated_at":"2025-11-09T14:06:37Z","body":"> I think it needs to consider escapes of the escape characters.\r\n>     * `{{`, `}}` , and `%%` are not placeholders.\r\n>     * `{{}}` is hightlighted incorrectly anyway (see the last character).\r\n\r\n`{{}}` is a bit weird, as it can be considered as the placeholder `{{}` followed by an extra `}`, OR the placeholder `{{}}` on its own, depending on what you pass as arguments:\r\n```gdscript\r\nprint(\"Hello {foo}: {{}}\".format({foo=\"World\", \"{\"=\"test\"}))  # prints Hello World: test}\r\nprint(\"Hello {foo}: {{}}\".format({foo=\"World\", \"{}\"=\"test\"}))  # prints Hello World: test\r\n```\r\nso the highlight is both correct and wrong :sweat_smile:\r\n\r\nIf you have `{{` in your string, but no `}`, nothing gets highlighted. However, if you mean strings like this one:\r\n```gdscript\r\n\"{{ this is } not intended\"\r\n```\r\nthen `{{ this is }` will be highlighted, and this behavior is correct. `}}` is never highlighted, unless an opening `{` is found before (but the second closing `}` will not be highlighted).\r\n\r\n`%%` is indeed not a placeholder per se, but it is a special (escape) sequence in strings that works the same way as percent-based placeholders, so I believe it makes sense to keep it highlighted as a \"placeholder\".\r\n\r\n@dalexeev I agree with your points. I personally prefer having what could be considered as \"false positives\", because the placeholders are indeed recognized, but you're free to use them or not. This is more questionable for `format()` placeholders, though, because of the possible customization, and of course all of this is subject to personal preference.\r\n\r\nI can see a couple options here:\r\n* Add an editor option to choose the placeholder highlighting style: none, `%...` only, or `%...` and `{...}`.\r\n* Use a regex: `(?:\\{.+?\\}|%%|%(?:\\+?\\-?0?(?:\\d+|\\*)?(?:\\.(?:\\d+|\\*))?[cdfosvxX]))` (I suppose this is not possible, as it would make the GDScript module depend on the RegEx module).\r\n\r\nI don't know how much of a problem it would be for the highlighter to look ahead for context, since it already does that to highlight string regions while looking for the region's `end_key`. But as you say, it would lead to false negatives if the formatting occurs at a later point.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3508389037/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3527791725","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112575#issuecomment-3527791725","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112575","id":3527791725,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7SRdRt","user":{"login":"Cykyrios","id":53737317,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNzM3MzE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53737317?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios","html_url":"https://github.com/Cykyrios","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-13T13:20:30Z","updated_at":"2025-11-13T13:20:51Z","body":"Applied suggested changes, and fixed backslash escape sequences not being highlighted inside brace-style placeholders, which required sorting the `color_map` dictionary keys.\r\n<img width=\"530\" height=\"50\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f5b2369b-8052-4f75-91a9-00365a472ee3\" />\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3527791725/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3529178958","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112575#issuecomment-3529178958","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112575","id":3529178958,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7SWv9O","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-13T18:37:35Z","updated_at":"2025-11-13T18:37:35Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3529178958/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_